[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2570762400","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101123#issuecomment-2570762400","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101123","id":2570762400,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ZOrig","user":{"login":"Ikanaut","id":193673221,"node_id":"U_kgDOC4s4BQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/193673221?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ikanaut","html_url":"https://github.com/Ikanaut","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ikanaut/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ikanaut/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ikanaut/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ikanaut/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ikanaut/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ikanaut/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ikanaut/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ikanaut/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ikanaut/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-04T08:36:13Z","updated_at":"2025-01-04T08:36:13Z","body":"Despite both the preview and the MRP using the procedural Sun as a test subject, the distortion covers everything on screen. It's just easiest to see this way.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2570762400/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2606645391","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101123#issuecomment-2606645391","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101123","id":2606645391,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6bXkCP","user":{"login":"lawnjelly","id":21999379,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxOTk5Mzc5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/21999379?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly","html_url":"https://github.com/lawnjelly","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-22T08:59:01Z","updated_at":"2025-01-22T08:59:01Z","body":"Am suspecting this issue is describing lack of mipmapping (or if there is mipmapping, it being an approximation), and aliasing on resize.\n\nI'm not super familiar with the viewports but I don't know offhand if it builds and uses mipmaps (or has option to). GPUs don't resize in the same way as e.g. photoshop as it is too expensive to do in realtime, so artifacts on resize are expected.\n\nIf you want a super crisp image from a viewport (and not using it for e.g. 2D with predefined sizes), one option is to resize your sub-viewport as the user modifies the main viewport size, so you get 1:1 ratio. This will have the bonus of better performance at small window sizes.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2606645391/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2610066300","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101123#issuecomment-2610066300","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101123","id":2610066300,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6bknN8","user":{"login":"Ikanaut","id":193673221,"node_id":"U_kgDOC4s4BQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/193673221?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ikanaut","html_url":"https://github.com/Ikanaut","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ikanaut/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ikanaut/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ikanaut/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ikanaut/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ikanaut/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ikanaut/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ikanaut/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ikanaut/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ikanaut/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-23T15:09:11Z","updated_at":"2025-01-30T06:51:21Z","body":"> If you want a super crisp image from a viewport (and not using it for e.g. 2D with predefined sizes), one option is to resize your sub-viewport as the user modifies the main viewport size, so you get 1:1 ratio. This will have the bonus of better performance at small window sizes.\n\nI'm not sure what you mean. If you mean scaling its resolution to match the window's, that's not going to help because the ViewportContainer node already does this and the glitch still persists even at a 'stretch_shrink' of 1. Higher values only make the grid-spaces of distortion bigger. This glitch also manifests in fullscreen.\nAdditionally, I've found that the filtering flag for ViewportTexture _appears_ to relieve the problem but on closer inspection it just _masks_ them.\nI suspect that the issue may be related to however the engine handles non-integer-multiples of the base resolution, but I don't know how to confirm this.\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2610066300/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2610314100","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101123#issuecomment-2610314100","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101123","id":2610314100,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6bljt0","user":{"login":"lawnjelly","id":21999379,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxOTk5Mzc5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/21999379?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly","html_url":"https://github.com/lawnjelly","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-23T16:26:49Z","updated_at":"2025-01-23T16:26:49Z","body":"Ah apologies you are likely correct (as I say I'm more familiar with engine internals than as a user :grin: ).\nWill try and look after weekend as I only have tablet.\n\nAlso it could be filtering of the texture used to draw to the viewport if this is 1:1.\nIt might be worth trying a texture and looking for aliasing artifacts.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2610314100/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2625227538","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101123#issuecomment-2625227538","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101123","id":2625227538,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6cecsS","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-30T18:10:48Z","updated_at":"2025-01-30T18:10:48Z","body":"- Related to https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/24201 (possible duplicate).","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/c